<Layout title="Terms of Use · skcal" description="The terms that govern your use of skcal.">
  <Nav />
  <article class="wrap legal">
    <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="legal-date">Last updated: 2026-11-11</p>
    <p>By using skcal you agree to these terms.</p>

    <h2>Use of the service</h2>
    <p>skcal is provided for personal health and fitness tracking. You're responsible for the accuracy of what you log and for keeping your account secure.</p>

    <h2>Not medical advice</h2>
    <p>skcal and its AI agent provide estimates and general guidance only. They are not medical, nutritional, or professional advice. Consult a qualified professional for health decisions.</p>

    <h2>AI features</h2>
    <p>Macro estimates and agent responses are generated by AI and may be inaccurate. Verify anything important.</p>

    <h2>Price</h2>
    <p>skcal is free to use, with every feature included. There is nothing to buy on the web or in the apps.</p>
    <p>A subscription bought before skcal became free keeps renewing until you cancel it, and cancelling doesn't change anything you can use. Cancelling stops the next renewal; we don't give refunds for partial months. Cancel it where you bought it:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>On the web:</strong> billed by Stripe. Cancel anytime from Billing in the web app.</li>
      <li><strong>In the iPhone app (skcal monthly):</strong> billed to your Apple ID. Cancel it in your App Store account settings, at least 24 hours before the current period ends to avoid the next renewal. App Store purchases are also subject to Apple's <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/">Licensed Application End User License Agreement</a>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>If skcal ever starts charging, we'll tell you before it applies.</p>

    <h2>Availability &amp; warranty</h2>
    <p>The service is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, and may change or be unavailable at any time. To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any damages arising from use of the service.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions: <a href="mailto:support@skcal.fit">support@skcal.fit</a>.</p>
  </article>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
